{"ref":"BDB, יִמְנָה","hw":"יִמְנָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יִמְנָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong>cf. perhaps Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">يُمْنٌ</span> <em>good fortune</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">يَمْنَةٌ</span> <em>right side</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  a son of Asher <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:17\" href=\"/Genesis.46.17\">Gn 46:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:44\" href=\"/Numbers.26.44\">Nu 26:44</a>, also (for adj. gent.) <span dir=\"rtl\">הַיִּמְנָה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:44\" href=\"/Numbers.26.44\">44</a> = the family of <em>the Yimnites</em> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:30\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.30\">1 Ch 7:30</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  a Levite <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.14\">2 Ch 31:14</a>.","next":"BDB, תֵּימָן","prev":"BDB, יָֽמִינִי"}